            "A lecture that is broken or missing.",
            "Authors and rights holders: removal requests.",
            "Feedback and ideas.",
            "Questions about Open University, an initiative of The Tower."
          ],
          "after": [
            "We read everything and usually reply within a few days."
          ]
        }
      ]
